      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start but i actually need you to go deeper into the logic itself. like, for the debate, i can't just say \"they were racists\"—i need to be able to present the actual intellectual or economic frameworks they used. \n\ncould you expand on the \"financial risk management\" part? instead of just saying they were \"falsely claiming\" things, can you outline the specific economic reasoning or the \"logic\" they used regarding property values and community stability? i really need to see how those arguments were structured to make them sound plausible in a debate setting.",
